{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read. A record dropped for room is reported as it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped; while that report waits unread, later ones merge into it, one report counting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them all across their timestamps. So the reports waiting unread hold at most one overflow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report between any two others (denials and finished trackers), however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overflow. The sequence has one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumer, and ends once the consent is gone."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV11dropReportsScSyAA0B10DropReportOGvp","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L